---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6">
    <header class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold">Terms of Use &amp; Directory Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">Last updated: September 25, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-inset p-5 text-sm text-body sm:p-6">
      <p class="font-semibold">Please read this page before you travel to any listing.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        We publish information about organizations that are not ours and that we do not control.
        Hours, addresses, phone numbers, and eligibility rules change without notice to us. Always
        call ahead before you go.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-5 rounded-2xl bg-card p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] sm:p-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Base Impact Inc. is a Florida nonprofit corporation. We are not yet a tax-exempt organization. Nothing on this site should be read to claim otherwise.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">2. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          By using baseimpact.org, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">3. The resource directory is third-party information</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          The directory lists food pantries, shelters, churches, government offices, and other organizations that are independent of Base Impact. A listing is a pointer to information we found and recorded on a given date. It is not a promise that the organization will serve you.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-muted">
          <li>We do not control any listed organization and cannot guarantee its hours, capacity, or eligibility rules.</li>
          <li>Some listings change seasonally, especially cold-weather shelters and mobile pantries.</li>
          <li><strong>Call before you travel.</strong> This is the single most important instruction on this page.</li>
          <li>If you find something wrong, please <a href="/feedback" class="font-semibold text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline">tell us</a> so we can correct it.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">4. No endorsement or affiliation</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Listing an organization is not an endorsement, certification, sponsorship, or recommendation by Base Impact.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">5. This site is not a crisis service</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          baseimpact.org is not monitored around the clock. If you are in danger, call 911. If you are in a mental-health crisis, call or text 988. For local assistance, call 211.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">6. No professional advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Content on this site is general information. It is not legal, medical, mental-health, tax, accounting, or financial advice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">7. No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          The site and all directory content are provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Base Impact Inc. will not be liable for any damages arising from your use of this site or your reliance on any listing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">9. External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Links to other websites are provided for convenience. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">10. Accessibility</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          We are building this site to be usable on a phone, on slow connections, and by people using screen readers. If you cannot access something you need, contact us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">11. Changes and governing law</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          We may update these terms as the organization grows. These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">12. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Questions, corrections, and removal requests:
          <a href="mailto:hello@baseimpact.org" class="font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">hello@baseimpact.org</a>
          or <a href="tel:+13213230999" class="font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">(321) 323-0999</a>,
          or use our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline">contact form</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="text-xs text-muted">
      This page is written to be clear and honest about our limits. It is not a substitute for
      review by a licensed Florida attorney.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>